        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "A weakly connected support allowing $\\nssp$ has at least $2n-1$\narcs. Consequently no sign pattern on a weakly connected support with\nat most $2n-2$ nonzero positions allows $\\nssp$.\nIf a connected $\\nssp$ matrix has exactly $2n-1$ nonzero entries,\nthen $\\dim\\Zc(A)=n$ and $T_A:\\Zc(A)\\to\\ker B$ is an isomorphism.",
